               , `local_lease_num`, `company_self_num`, `plan_entry_time`, `plan_exit_time`, `is_special`, `create_user`, `create_user_name`
               , `create_time`, `update_user`, `update_user_name`, `update_time`, `del_user`, `del_time`, `del_flag`, `remark`, `pt_var1`
